WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.830
- Time's almost up on this
hour now, but not quite yet.

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:04.810
We have one more inspiring story to share,

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.093
this is What I'm Liking.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.770
So six years ago, Leo moved

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.550
to Illinois from the Philippines.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.720
He was nervous about the
move, but he settled in

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:18.160
with a job as a janitor at
a local elementary school.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:21.340
The students and faculty
welcomed Leo with open arms.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.530
In fact, they call him Mr. Leo.

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:27.110
Last year, he applied for
citizenship and on January 24th,

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.179
he was sworn in as a US citizen.

00:00:29.179 --> 00:00:31.520
(audience applauds)
That's right.

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:34.627
The next day, this is
how students greeted him.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:41.320
- [Students] Yay!

00:00:46.376 --> 00:00:47.959
Leo! Leo! Leo! Leo!

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.660
Leo! Leo! Leo! Leo! Leo!

00:00:54.357 --> 00:00:56.120
- It's so sweet.
(audience applauds)

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:00.973
We have Mr. Leo on the line,
so congratulations, Mr. Leo!

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:02.860
(audience applauds)

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:03.983
- Hi Kelly.

00:01:03.983 --> 00:01:06.580
- Hi, so I have to ask, what was it like

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.630
walking to the hallway and
everybody cheering for you?

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:12.180
- Oh, it was so surprising.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:15.450
I was so surprised when I got in the door

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:19.500
and right from there, I already was crying

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.130
because of the kids shouting, "Leo! Leo!"

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:26.107
and it was so heartwarming
and overwhelming for me.

00:01:26.107 --> 00:01:28.502
- Oh my God, and it's also...

00:01:28.502 --> 00:01:32.150
This is also meaningful for
you for other reasons, right?

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:35.230
- Because coming into the United States

00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:38.564
through a petition of my
son, who is a nurse here.

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:42.460
He wanted me to help with
the household, with the kids.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:47.150
So I drove the kids, I
take good care of the kids.

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:51.230
Then it so happened that
there was a job opening

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:52.880
at Charles Street elementary school

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:57.010
so I applied for it as a
custodian and until now I'm here.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:00.320
I love my job, I love
the kids and the staff

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:03.520
for their overwhelming support for me

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.240
as I do my job for them.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:06.570
- Aw, I love it.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.970
Thank you so much Mr. Leo,
for sharing this with us.

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:10.790
It's such a great story.

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:12.760
I'm so proud of you, I'm happy for you.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.590
This is awesome for your family.

00:02:14.590 --> 00:02:17.010
I love that you're able to
be there for your grandkids.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:19.960
I'm liking your post right now, all right?

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.750
All right, well that's not all, Mr. Leo.

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:24.800
Our season long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:26.880
the go-to pen of The Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.020
they want to honor ultimate overachievers

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:29.853
just like you, sir.

00:02:29.853 --> 00:02:31.087
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:02:31.087 --> 00:02:33.059
for a thousand dollars, how's that sound?

00:02:33.059 --> 00:02:34.575
(audience applauds)

00:02:34.575 --> 00:02:37.140
- Oh thank you, thank you so much.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:39.590
- [Kelly] Yeah, have a
good time with that money!

